      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794073597422,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mounting = hanging a disk on a folder of the one tree.\nAfter step 1, anything written under /mnt/data lands on\nthe 32 GB data disk; everything else stays on the OS\ndisk.\n\nRestore is the same road backwards: download the\n.tar.gz, let Compose make an empty notes_data, unpack\nit with tar xzf, start postgres. You get back what was\nthere when the backup was made.",
      "originalText": "Mounting = hanging a disk on a folder of the one tree.\nAfter step 1, anything written under /mnt/data lands on\nthe 32 GB data disk; everything else stays on the OS\ndisk.\n\nRestore is the same road backwards: download the\n.tar.gz, let Compose make an empty notes_data, unpack\nit with tar xzf, start postgres. You get back what was\nthere when the backup was made.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mzzna1k1hfzx",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
