      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# 4. pack the volume (db stopped)\ndocker run --rm -v notes_data:/data:ro \\\n  -v /mnt/data/backups:/backup alpine \\\n  tar czf /backup/notes-data.tar.gz -C /data .\n# 5. send it out\naz storage blob upload --auth-mode login ...",
      "originalText": "# 4. pack the volume (db stopped)\ndocker run --rm -v notes_data:/data:ro \\\n  -v /mnt/data/backups:/backup alpine \\\n  tar czf /backup/notes-data.tar.gz -C /data .\n# 5. send it out\naz storage blob upload --auth-mode login ...",
